min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Battery Equipment" data-action="url" data-href="/collections/battery-powered-equipment" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg rid-149"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO rid-6"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/battery-powered-equipment" target="_self">Battery Equipment</a></h3></div></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Previous" style="visibility:hidden" class="pf-slider-prev none"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Next" style="visibility:hidden" class="pf-slider-next none"></button></div></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-2596" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-68_"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-69_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/5E8A9526-Russo-delivery-truck-naperville_500x.jpg?v=1748572169" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/5E8A9526-Russo-delivery-truck-naperville.jpg?v=1748572169 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/5E8A9526-Russo-delivery-truck-naperville_500x.jpg?v=1748572169 320w" width="1200" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo delivery truck naperville" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-70_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-71_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-72_">Why a New Brand Asset? Why Now?</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-74_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">As Russo grows—both in footprint and customer diversity—we’re entering markets where people don’t yet know us. They haven’t seen our 50+ years of service. They don’t know that we bend over backward to get contractors back on the job, or that we service what we sell, or that we keep deep inventory year-round when others don’t.<br><br>So we asked: <strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">How do we introduce ourselves to someone who’s never heard of Russo?</span></span></strong><br><br>Outdoor Power Plus helps answer that. It pairs with the Russo logo&nbsp;and strengthens our first impression by clearly stating what we do—and hinting at all the extra value we bring.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-76_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-c415" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-78_"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-79_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse_500x.jpg?v=1748571743" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse.jpg?v=1748571743 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse_500x.jpg?v=1748571743 320w" width="1200" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo Elgin forklift warehouse" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-80_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-81_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-82_">Where We've Been: A Legacy of Service</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-84_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">For over five decades, <strong>customer service has been at the core of Russo's success</strong>. In the Midwest, we're known for helping pros keep moving—fixing it, finding it, or staying late to make it happen. This brand was built on hustle, relationships, and respect for the working professional.<br></p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-86_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-e802" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-88_"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-89_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web_500x.jpg?v=1749231897" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web.jpg?v=1749231897 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web_500x.jpg?v=1749231897 320w" width="1199" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web.jpg__PID:b9073387-b7ca-4b96-b93e-c477214237e7" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-90_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-91_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-92_">Who We’re Talking To: Pros, Prosumers &amp; Landowners</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-94_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our customer base is evolving. In new territories, we’re seeing more landowners, property managers, acreage owners, and serious DIYers—alongside our core pro contractors. That’s why the message must flex. <br><br>Our sales pitch—or as we fondly call it, the <em>barstool pitch</em>—starts with a question:&nbsp;<strong>“<span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Do you take care of your own property?</span>”</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong>•&nbsp;No?</strong></span><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></span></strong> Well, then we sell everything your contractor uses to maintain your grounds, landscape or snow.<br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong>•&nbsp;Yes?</strong></span><strong><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);"></span></strong> Then we can sell you everything a pro would use to maintain your grounds, landscape or snow.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-96_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-b5ef" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-98_"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-99_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale_500x.jpg?v=1785335411" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale.jpg?v=1785335411 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale_500x.jpg?v=1785335411 320w" width="800" height="1066" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale.jpg__PID:23ac8424-f8ea-4e6c-b55f-1786bb781b32" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-100_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-101_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-102_">About the Logo</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-104_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The Outdoor Power Plus brand asset was&nbsp;designed to complement&nbsp;the Russo logo—it reinforces our core identity while adding a fresh layer of meaning. While the two are often used together in a lockup, they don’t always have to appear side by side.<br><br>This flexibility allows us to honor Russo as the master brand while giving us a way to speak more directly in different markets. Whether on a store sign, in an ad, or across a digital campaign, this new asset&nbsp;adds meaning without taking away from who we are.<br> </p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-EhWEN fSLKHX pf-106_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-107_">"Outdoor Power" is familiar and instantly communicates our category.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-109_">"Plus"—in its distinctive script—signals retail warmth, openness, and more.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-111_">Together, they&nbsp;reinforce what Russo has always delivered: more parts, more brands, more expertise, and more support.</li></ul><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-113_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">It doesn’t replace Russo—it enhances it.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-115_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-ebff" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-117_"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-118_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-119_">What It Means to Us</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-121_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Outdoor Power Plus is more than a logo—it’s a mindset. It’s how we:</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-EhWEN fSLKHX pf-123_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-124_">Serve every customer like they’ve been with us for years</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-126_">Grow with purpose</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-128_">Keep our word</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-130_">Stand behind what we sell</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-dwxWWy cwytyb pf-132_">Equip the pros and empower the landowners</li></ul><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-134_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Whether you're meeting Russo for the first time or have been with us since the beginning, Outdoor Power Plus is your reminder that we’re built to do more—for you, for your crew, and for the future of this industry.</p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-136_"><a href="/collections/power-equipment" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-137_ pf-button-2">Explore Our Products</a><a href="/pages/storelocator" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-139_ pf-button-2">Find a Russo Location</a><a href="/pages/all-season-contractor" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-141_ pf-button-2">Learn About What We Provide</a></div><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-143_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section style="--overlay:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)" data-section-id="pf-f58a" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-145_ pf-container-1 pf-bg-lazy"><div class="sc-igOmKM gjlRHr"></div><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;--llo-xs:0;--llo-sm:0;--llo-md:0;--llo-lg:0" data-pf-type="ContentList2" class="sc-ikXyAm sc-uxgrH gYmtkP kWKtJq pf-146_"><div class="pf-slider pf-c-ct pf-r-eh" style="--ss-xs:2;--ss-sm:4;--ss-md:4;--ss-lg:4" data-slider="{'navStyle':'none','maxHeight':true,'listLayout':{'all':0,'laptop':0,'tablet':0,'mobile':0},'slidesToShow':{'all':4,'laptop':4,'tablet':'4','mobile':2},'slidesToScroll':{'all':3,'laptop':3,'tablet':2,'mobile':1},'paginationStyle':'none','displayPartialItems':{'all':false,'laptop':false,'tablet':false,'mobile':false},'spacing':{'all':'30px','laptop':'30px','tablet':'30px','mobile':'16px'}}"><div class="pf-slide"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-dkQVVi itKKTi rid-80"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ rid-10"><h3 data-pf-ty