nbsp;<a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/russo-outdoor-power-plus-davenport-ia" target="_self">AE Outdoor Power</a>, <a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/russo-outdoor-power-plus-davenport-ia" target="_self">QC Power Equipment</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/russo-outdoor-power-plus-valparaiso-in" target="_self">Gruel Bros., Inc.</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/lebanon-in" target="_self">Howard's</a>, and <a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/greenfield-in" target="_self">Superior Mowers</a> we’re honoring their history while equipping their teams with more tools to succeed. It's growth rooted in respect—for the people, the place, and the profession.</p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-178_"><a href="/blogs/russo-news/honoring-legacies" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-179_ pf-button-2">Read Their Stories</a></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-181_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo-Locations-Map-with-Acquisitions_SEPT2025_500x.jpg?v=1794257020" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo-Locations-Map-with-Acquisitions_SEPT2025.jpg?v=1794257020 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo-Locations-Map-with-Acquisitions_SEPT2025_500x.jpg?v=1794257020 320w" width="800" height="584" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo Locations Map updated Nov 2026" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-182_"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-183_">Midwest Plus. </h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-185_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our roots are here. We value what the Midwest stands for: honesty, hard work, and community. That culture lives in our People Power’d approach and defines how we serve.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-187_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-f442" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-189_ pf-container-1 pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-190_">TESTIMONIALS</h3><div data-pf-type="Slideshow" class="sc-GvePw gOcULa pf-192_"><div data-id="slider-6cf442af-c81c-4cfc-8317-40b23849129a-all" class="pf-slider scrollfix" style="--ss-xs:1;--ss-sm:1;--ss-md:1;--ss-lg:1"><div class="pf-slide"><div class="sc-kJNstA ewpbJQ pf-193_" data-pf-type="SlideshowSlide"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-194_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/t/10/assets/pf-559296bd--Lifeline-44_500x.png?v=1604479451" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/t/10/assets/pf-559296bd--Lifeline-44.png?v=1604479451 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/t/10/assets/pf-559296bd--Lifeline-44_500x.png?v=1604479451 320w" width="900" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-195_"/><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-196_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">A fantastic organisation! Great customer support from beginning to end of the process. The team are really informed and go the extra mile at every stage. I would recommend them unreservedly.</p></div></div></div><div class="pf-slide"><div class="sc-kJNstA ewpbJQ pf-198_" data-pf-type="SlideshowSlide"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-199_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/t/10/assets/image61--edited-1663728916459_500x.jpg?v=1663728918" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/t/10/assets/image61--edited-1663728916459.jpg?v=1663728918 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/t/10/assets/image61--edited-1663728916459_500x.jpg?v=1663728918 320w" width="900" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-200_"/><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-201_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Great service, efficient communication and a really easy way to get a mortgage with lots of help and support to get the right deal.</p></div></div></div><div class="pf-slide"><div class="sc-kJNstA ewpbJQ pf-203_" data-pf-type="SlideshowSlide"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-204_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/t/10/assets/rectangle291653645294825-1666927119401.webp?v=1666927120" loading="lazy" width="900" height="600" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-205_"/><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-206_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Very polite and helpful customer service. Response was very satisfactory, especially when my family and I face the current health emergency.</p></div></div></div><button type="button" style="visibility:hidden" aria-label="Previous" class="pf-slider-prev nav-style-1 "></button><button type="button" style="visibility:hidden" aria-label="Next" class="pf-slider-next nav-style-1 "></button></div></div></div></section></div></div></div><script>
